  "about": "Biķernieki, Latvija (id bikernieki): the circuit in the Biķernieki forest park on the east side of Riga, its car layout (Ātruma aplis, the speed ring: 3.65 km, 14 corners, clockwise), one lap (docs/nove-proge-1-0.md A6, docs/proge/bikernieki.md). The route: OSM's highway=raceway ways named Biķernieku trase and their unnamed links, clockwise as raced: from the start line on the main straight (node 1080542036) south to the hairpin by the bleachers, north-west up the diagonal and the infield's west road, past the lake Linezers, round the north loop through the woods and back down the north-east bends to the main straight. The raceway network has other loops (the infield's twisty kart and drift roads, partly gravel, the long south-west loop of the old layout): not on this route.",
